{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the name suggests, <i><strong>Iser Survival(Demo)</strong></i> is a survival game at its core\u2014but it offers much more. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Overview (Demo)</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded on the planet Iser, you must manage vital stats like <strong>Hunger, Thirst</strong>. Lower stats impose harsher penalties. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Injuries and illnesses also threaten your survival\u2014let any attribute drop too low, and your life is at risk. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Farming \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather food from the wild or grow your own crops for sustainable survival. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough begins with <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong>, ensuring no two runs are the same. Exploration stays unpredictable, delivering fresh adventures each time. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized enemies and loot create dynamic encounters that fit the world\u2019s lore. Face off against procedurally generated foes\u2014from common threats to elite enemies and bosses\u2014ensuring every battle feels unique. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Progression\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like an RPG skill tree, your <strong>attribute allocation</strong>\u00a0determines usable weapons and items. Different builds unlock unique passive effects, shaping your combat playstyle. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417670?t=1751692948","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417670?t=1751692948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417670/cad1ebde2036f29014400d0d6f9cbb22bba29dc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751692948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417670/cad1ebde2036f29014400d0d6f9cbb22bba29dc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751692948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the name suggests, <i><strong>Iser Survival(Demo)</strong></i> is a survival game at its core\u2014but it offers much more. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Overview (Demo)</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded on the planet Iser, you must manage vital stats like <strong>Hunger, Thirst</strong>. Lower stats impose harsher penalties. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Injuries and illnesses also threaten your survival\u2014let any attribute drop too low, and your life is at risk. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Farming \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather food from the wild or grow your own crops for sustainable survival. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough begins with <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong>, ensuring no two runs are the same. Exploration stays unpredictable, delivering fresh adventures each time. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized enemies and loot create dynamic encounters that fit the world\u2019s lore. Face off against procedurally generated foes\u2014from common threats to elite enemies and bosses\u2014ensuring every battle feels unique. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Progression\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like an RPG skill tree, your <strong>attribute allocation</strong>\u00a0determines usable weapons and items. Different builds unlock unique passive effects, shaping your combat playstyle. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Oranwinter"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3159790","name":"Iser Survival"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417670/1c727655c0476bbc43004e40b723799833b626b4/header.jpg?t=1751692948","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257163432,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163432/movie480.mp4?t=1751376478","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163432/movie_max.mp4?t=1751376478"},"name":"YouDead","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163432/b0cc2b8d1714a1a1c790f2a2f4e7544b6b3931d7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751376478","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163432/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751376478","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163432/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751376478